      "mergedPostDetails": "**Description**\n\nWhile we are in an invite only instance of another user, we can see unclickable accept check of Request Invite notification on the menu, and it's not grayed out.\n\nIt is very confusing because it is unclickable but appears normal.\n\nIt should be grayed out or should not be shown.\n\n**日本語要約**\n\n他者のInvite Onlyインスタンスに居る、インスタンスオーナーでない人がReqinを受け取った際、グレーアウトしていないが押せない☑が表示されているバグです。\n\n**Related Canny**\n\nI and one of my friends create multiple Canny about Request Invite.\n\nRequest Inviteに関連する幾つかのCannyを同時に作成しました。\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-grayed-out-or-not-present-when-im-in-an (this canny)\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-if-im-in-friends-instance\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-clickable-after-moving-to-friends-or-pu\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-after-moving-to-invite-in",
