  "details": "Invite requests sent to a user in an invite only instance who is not the instance creator cannot be accepted, however the GUI doesn't show this.\n\nThe check-mark to accept the invite does not animate like the rest of the QM's UI, and can't be interacted with.\n\nThis can lead users to believe they accepted an invite request when in reality, they haven't.\n\nUnable to test on Quest or Pico",
